-- The built-in sounds, written as .neomusic sound definitions. Each one here
-- equals the preset of the same name exactly (a test checks), so this file is
-- what the presets mean. Times are seconds, frequencies Hz, pitches semitones,
-- cutoffs octaves above C4 (hz f converts). velocity is applied only where amp says so.

sound basic
  osc saw
  amp velocity * adsr 0.005 0 1 0.05
  pitch 0
  cutoff hz 20000
  resonance 0  highpass 0  width 0

-- Bright plucked saw; velocity opens the filter.
sound pluck from basic
  osc saw unison 3 detune 14
  osc square up 12 gain 0.25
  amp velocity * adsr 0.002 0.4 0 0.3
  cutoff filter 450 0.5 (adsr 0.001 0.2 0 0.2) 3.5 1.2
  resonance 0.3  width 0.6

-- Seven detuned saws plus a sub-octave, slow attack, wide stereo.
sound supersaw from basic
  osc saw unison 7 detune 38
  osc saw up -12 gain 0.35
  amp velocity * adsr 0.4 0.6 0.8 1.2
  cutoff filter 900 0.3 (adsr 0.5 1.5 0.4 1) 1.5 2
  resonance 0.15  width 1

-- Two slowly beating saws over a sine sub, low-passed.
sound reeseBass from basic
  osc saw unison 2 detune 22
  osc sine up -12 gain 0.8
  amp velocity * adsr 0.005 0.3 0.8 0.08
  cutoff filter 160 0 (adsr 0.002 0.25 0 0.1) 2.5 1
  resonance 0.25  width 0.3

sound subBass from basic
  osc sine
  osc triangle gain 0.12
  amp velocity * adsr 0.01 0 1 0.1

-- Sine with a fast pitch drop: tune the note to the body (about 40-60 Hz).
sound kick from basic
  osc sine
  amp velocity * adsr 0.001 0.35 0 0.05
  pitch approach 36 0 (4.6 * 0.035)

-- Noise burst over a pitched triangle body.
sound snare from basic
  osc noise unison 2
  osc triangle gain 0.6
  amp velocity * adsr 0.001 0.22 0 0.08
  pitch approach 7 0 (4.6 * 0.03)
  cutoff hz 8000  highpass 180  width 0.3

-- Closed hi-hat: short high-passed noise.
sound hat from basic
  osc noise unison 2
  amp velocity * adsr 0.001 0.05 0 0.03
  highpass 7000  width 0.4

-- Noise swell whose resonant filter sweeps up over about four seconds.
sound noiseSweep from basic
  osc noise unison 2
  amp velocity * adsr 3 0 1 0.3
  cutoff filter 250 0 (adsr 4 0 1 0.3) 5.5 0
  resonance 0.55  highpass 120  width 1

sound sine from basic
  osc sine
  amp velocity * adsr 0.005 0 1 0.015
sound saw from sine
  osc saw
sound square from sine
  osc square

-- A synthesized piano-like tone, not a sampled piano.
sound piano from basic
  osc sine
  osc sine up 12 gain 0.35
  osc sine up 19 gain 0.12
  amp velocity * adsr 0.002 1.2 0.15 0.15
